{"id":"0d51af52-185d-4c5c-a1c2-28b28d771219","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"f93cb125d52dd486","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/cspell/server-node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"45f1da2db3a53bebb7738d878f612fc40d9ab017","start":3213,"end":3249},"shape":{"type":"ObjectElement","atoms":["\"","severity","\"",":","DiagnosticSeverity",".","Hint",","]},"context":{"before":"02320028df95c1a1","after":"b2609c25a8019efb"}},"payload":{"text":"(a hint: dots under the word and its message on hover, not a row in Problems, where a file's worth drowned\neverything else)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:21.697Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:21.697Z"}
{"id":"71a3f319-982c-4f7f-897a-f98c795c7cab","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"1c930e53e9b81fce#0","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/cspell/server-node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"43c20011f6880b684b45505cffa82d023207e8ed","start":0,"end":6},"shape":{"type":"Keyword","atoms":["import"]},"context":{"after":"d1f2155cf1bb3740#0"}},"payload":{"text":"cspell language server — a NODE server run under almostnode. It spell-checks documents with the REAL cspell\nengine (cspell-lib), which is a node-only tool: it reads its dictionary (a gzipped trie) off \"disk\" and\ngunzips it. Under almostnode that disk is the VFS and the gunzip is almostnode's zlib shim, so cspell runs\nunmodified in the browser — which is the whole point of the almostnode host: node-only language tooling with\nno node backend. It speaks LSP over the worker's message channel (`vscode-languageserver/browser`), so to\nthe client it's an ordinary worker server.\n\ncspell-lib and the LSP library are bundled in (bundledNodeServer in build.ts). The dictionary is too big to bundle, so\nserver-host fetches it and writes it to the VFS at DICT_PATH before this server runs.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:25.550Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:25.550Z"}
{"id":"826ab4bb-47f6-474d-b5a0-c078beeb956d","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"26e00e982aa7d6f0","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/cspell/server-node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"5124bdaa24d138b1195d0b18d3ca3318fa6d02dd","start":4053,"end":4167},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["check","(","params",".","textDocument",".","uri",",","languages",".","get","(","params",".","textDocument",".","uri",")","??","\"","plaintext","\"",",","text",")",".","catch","(","(",")","=>","undefined",")"]},"context":{"before":"bc778a1eda70c31e","after":"3f696061c79dd7cc"}},"payload":{"text":"(languageId isn't sent on change: the one it opened with)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:20.824Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:20.824Z"}
{"id":"ab5a4165-3ecf-4db6-90b3-13b4702d0bf8","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"587b71bc95786262","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/cspell/server-node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"01841fda760ade2a532189dae47507f7edf004b7","start":2714,"end":2780},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","textDocument","=","TextDocument",".","create","(","uri",",","languageId",",","0",",","text",")"]},"context":{"before":"7f949647a2a3c930","after":"94a9578ca57236d9"}},"payload":{"text":"cspell reports issues by absolute character offset; the editor wants line/character ranges.\nvscode-languageserver-textdocument's TextDocument.positionAt does exactly that conversion.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:22.470Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:22.470Z"}
{"id":"c386ee0e-4101-453d-b2a9-8e0eff14be43","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"84f2147a9e2e97b1","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/cspell/server-node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"350d96549cdace4251ac15e070385c790608b25e","start":2158,"end":2311},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","connection","=","createConnection","(","new","BrowserMessageReader","(","globalThis","as","unknown","as","Worker",")",",","new","BrowserMessageWriter","(","globalThis","as","unknown","as","Worker",")",")"]},"context":{"before":"b3779cb76834c042","after":"36d3444695d4dc9a"}},"payload":{"text":"In the worker (shared globalThis) this is the DedicatedWorkerGlobalScope the client talks to.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:23.266Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:23.266Z"}
{"id":"c40e250a-030e-46e7-bc0d-33e896fb5cb2","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"62c23ade32a45e73","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/cspell/server-node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"3caf926e856b03efd57d265211e7c436bbebd517","start":1173,"end":1710},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","settings","=","{","\"","version","\"",":","\"","0.2","\"","as","const",",","\"","language","\"",":","\"","en","\"",",","\"","dictionaryDefinitions","\"",":","DICTIONARIES",".","map","(","(","dictionary",")","=>","(","{","\"","name","\"",":","dictionary",".","name",",","\"","path","\"",":","\"","/dicts/","\"","+","servedName","(","dictionary",")","}",")",")",",","\"","dictionaries","\"",":","DICTIONARIES",".","filter","(","(","dictionary",")","=>","dictionary",".","languages","===","undefined",")",".","map","(","(","dictionary",")","=>","dictionary",".","name",")",",","\"","languageSettings","\"",":","DICTIONARIES",".","filter","(","(","dictionary",")","=>","dictionary",".","languages","!==","undefined",")",".","map","(","(","dictionary",")","=>","(","{","\"","languageId","\"",":","(","dictionary",".","languages","??","[","]",")",".","join","(","\"",",","\"",")",",","\"","dictionaries","\"",":","[","dictionary",".","name","]","}",")",")","}"]},"context":{"before":"867ec57f3a922262","after":"b3779cb76834c042"}},"payload":{"text":"cspell's dictionaries for code (dictionaries.ts), each read from where server-host wrote it in the VFS: the ones for\nevery language always, the rest for theirs. We deliberately skip getDefaultSettings() (it eagerly references all ~59\nbundled dicts) and config search: these alone.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:24.807Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:27:24.807Z"}
